### tests/requests.http — Postman flows for Diagram 1 (VS Code REST Client or Postman import)
### Base URL for `npm run dev` is http://localhost:4004
### CONCEPT: mocked auth uses Basic, real IdPs use Bearer. Both end at same req.user.

@base = http://localhost:4004
# Base64: alice:alice -> YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U= | bob:bob -> Ym9iOmJvYg== | erin:erin -> ZXJpbjplcmVu

### 1) PHASE 7 — No credentials -> 401 Unauthorized (diagram: Valid? --No--> 401)
GET {{base}}/bookstore/WhoAmI

### 2) PHASE 7 — alice (admin+Viewer) sees her req.user {id, roles, attr}
GET {{base}}/bookstore/WhoAmI
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U=

### 3) bob (Viewer only)
GET {{base}}/bookstore/WhoAmI
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOmJvYg==

### 4) erin (Support, department=support)
GET {{base}}/bookstore/WhoAmI
Authorization: Basic ZXJpbjplcmVu

### 5) ROLE-BASED READ — bob MAY read books (has Viewer) -> 200
GET {{base}}/bookstore/BookList
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOmJvYg==

### 6) ROLE-BASED WRITE — bob may NOT create (needs admin) -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{base}}/bookstore/BookList
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOmJvYg==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ID": 99, "title": "Hacker Book", "author": "mallory", "price": 1.00, "country": "IN" }

### 7) Same CREATE as alice (admin) -> 201 Created
POST {{base}}/bookstore/BookList
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U=
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ID": 10, "title": "Secure CAP", "author": "alice", "price": 42.00, "country": "DE" }

### 8) INPUT VALIDATION — stored-XSS blocked -> 400 (see service.js)
POST {{base}}/bookstore/BookList
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U=
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ID": 11, "title": "<script>alert(1)</script>", "author": "x", "price": 9.99, "country": "DE" }

### 9) ATTRIBUTE FILTER — erin sees ONLY support incidents (req.user.attr.department)
GET {{base}}/bookstore/IncidentList
Authorization: Basic ZXJpbjplcmVu

### 10) Same list as alice (admin bypasses filter, sees all)
GET {{base}}/bookstore/IncidentList
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U=

### 11) ACTION — bob (no admin) -> 403, alice -> 200
POST {{base}}/bookstore/pingAdminOnly
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOmJvYg==
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12) PROD SHAPE — Bearer JWT (works after `cf push` with ias/xsuaa binding)
### Replace PASTE_JWT with token from `npm run token` (learning) or IAS (real).
# GET {{base}}/bookstore/WhoAmI
# Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT
